@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Send to two numbers (run twice: same key → same message, nothing new is sent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: debug-1

{ "to": ["050-1234567", "+972521112233"], "body": "Shift starts at 07:00" }

### Validation error: second number is invalid → 400 with "to[1]"
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": ["0501234567", "123"], "body": "Hello" }

### Get one message (paste an id from a response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List, newest first; pass nextCursor from the previous response as cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages?status=Pending&limit=20

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
